---
layout: base.njk
title: Epic adventures for solo moms
description: She Dares To Go helps solo moms create epic hikes, road trips, and travel adventures with their kids, no partner required.
hero_image: /images/hero.jpg
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>You can be a solo mom and still travel.</h1>
    <p class="subline">I help solo moms create epic adventures with their kids. Hikes, road trips, and travel, without waiting for a partner to come along.</p>
    <div class="buttons">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/blog/">Read the blog</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="{{ site.plannerUrl }}">Get my free 10-minute trip planner</a>
    </div>
    <img class="hero-photo" src="{{ hero_image }}" alt="Shaneice and her daughter standing on red rocks in the desert at golden hour" />
    <svg class="peaks" viewBox="0 0 1200 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M0,70 L0,45 L120,10 L240,50 L360,18 L480,55 L600,12 L720,48 L840,20 L960,52 L1080,15 L1200,45 L1200,70 Z" fill="#173b32" opacity="0.10"/>
      <path d="M0,70 L0,58 L150,30 L300,60 L450,35 L600,62 L750,32 L900,58 L1050,34 L1200,56 L1200,70 Z" fill="#c1704f" opacity="0.16"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section latest">
  <p class="eyebrow">Fresh off the road</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Latest from the blog</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
      <a class="card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <div class="card-img">
          {% if post.data.image %}
            <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" loading="lazy" />
          {% else %}
            <div class="card-img-fallback" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="card-meta">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</p>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="freebie-band">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free for you</p>
    <h2>Get your free 10-Minute Trip Planner</h2>
    <p>It finds where to go, where to eat, what it will cost, and builds your full itinerary. Plan your next trip in 10 minutes, not 10 hours of scrolling.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.plannerUrl }}">Get the free planner</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <p class="eyebrow">Pack like a pro</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">My favorite gear</h2>
  <p class="page-sub" style="max-width:36rem;">The tried-and-true picks I actually pack for our adventures. No fluff, only the stuff that earns its spot in the car.</p>
  <div class="buttons" style="justify-content:flex-start; margin-top:1.5rem;">
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/gear/">Browse my gear</a>
    {% include "amazon-btn.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  <div class="guide">
    <img class="guide-photo" src="/images/shaneice.jpg" alt="Shaneice, creator of She Dares To Go" />
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet your adventure guide</p>
      <h2>Hey, I'm Shaneice</h2>
      <p>I'm a Virginia-based photographer and adventure travel creator. For six years I've been traveling solo with my daughter, proving you don't need another adult to have epic adventures. This blog is where I share the trips, the honest reviews, and the plans.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/about/">More about me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="insta-band">
    <p class="eyebrow">Come say hi</p>
    <h2>Follow along on Instagram @shedarestogo</h2>
    <p>Daily adventures, behind the scenes, and the real talk that does not make the blog.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-light" href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow @shedarestogo</a>
  </div>
</section>
